    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      453.13,
      538.88,
      476.2
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 19 read with Section 51 of the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance, do by this Order promulgate the following regulations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      424.89,
      489.13,
      528.79,
      512.2
    ],
    "text": "MANGALA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Finance",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      525.13,
      132.45,
      560.2
    ],
    "text": "Ministry of Finance,Colombo 01,March 05, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      259.77,
      573.13,
      326.97,
      584.2
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      76.05,
      597.13,
      526.7,
      608.2
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Finance (Luxury Tax on Motor Vehicle) Regulations, No. 1 of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      77.13,
      621.13,
      533.18,
      632.2
    ],
    "text": "2. The date for the purposes of Sections 19, 20 and 21 of the Finance Act, No. 35 of 2018 shall be March 6, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      76.05,
      645.13,
      538.91,
      668.2
    ],
    "text": "3. The luxury tax on motor vehicle payable in terms of Section 19 of the Act, on any specified motor vehicleimported into Sri Lanka -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.37,
      509.12,
      93.33
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'03'05PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 05.03.20192A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      103.27,
      105.13,
      546.25,
      128.2
    ],
    "text": "(a) on or after March 6, 2019 shall be paid to the Director-General of Customs, by the person importingsuch vehicle, at the time of removing the vehicle from Sri Lanka Customs.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      102.67,
      141.13,
      546.26,
      176.2
    ],
    "text": "(b) prior to March 6, 2019 or assembled in Sri Lanka shall be paid by the registered owner of such vehicle tothe Commissioner-General of Motor Traffic at the time of issuing the first Certificate of Registration inrespect of such vehicle.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      84.43,
      189.13,
      546.28,
      236.2
    ],
    "text": "4. The tax shall be charged on every specified motor vehicle, of which the Cost, Insurance Freight (CIF) value or theEx-factory Cost (Manufacturer\u2019s Price) as the case may be, in exceeding the Luxury Tax free threshold as specifiedin Column I and II of the Schedule hereto, at the rate specified in the corresponding entry in Column III, of thesaid Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.15,
      249.13,
      242.55,
      260.2
    ],
    "text": "For the purpose of this Regulations,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      109.75,
      273.13,
      546.28,
      308.2
    ],
    "text": "i. \u201cLuxury Tax free threshold\u201d means the maximum luxury tax free value of the Cost Insurance Freight(CIF) value or the Ex-factory Cost (Manufacturer\u2019s Price), as the case may be, of a motor vehicle asdefined in the Column II of the Schedule to these Regulations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
